# Tensor-Like Marketplace — Next Phases

> Goal: Evolve the marketplace into a full Tensor-like trading platform.

---

## Phase 7: Collection Browsing & NFT Grid (Tensor-style)

### Collection Page Overhaul
- [ ] Redesign `collections/[slug].stx` with Tensor-style layout: banner, stats bar, tab navigation
- [ ] Add real-time stats row: floor price, listed count, total volume, owners, best offer
- [ ] Implement NFT grid with card view (image, name, price, rarity badge, last sale)
- [ ] Add list view toggle (compact table like Tensor's list mode)
- [ ] Infinite scroll / pagination for the NFT grid
- [ ] Loading skeletons for NFT cards

### Filtering & Sorting
- [ ] Attribute filter sidebar (trait type → trait value with counts)
- [ ] Filter by listing status: listed / unlisted / has offers / in auction
- [ ] Filter by price range (min/max SOL)
- [ ] Filter by rarity level (Common / Uncommon / Rare / Legendary)
- [ ] Sort: price low→high, price high→low, rarity, recently listed, recently sold
- [ ] Search by NFT name or token ID
- [ ] Persist filter/sort state in URL query params
- [ ] Mobile-friendly filter drawer

### API Support
- [ ] Add `GET /marketplace/collections/{slug}/nfts` with filter/sort/pagination query params
- [ ] Add `GET /marketplace/collections/{slug}/stats` for real-time stats
- [ ] Add attribute aggregation endpoint for filter counts

---

## Phase 8: NFT Detail Page

- [ ] Create `nfts/[id].stx` detail page
- [ ] Full-size NFT artwork display with zoom
- [ ] Attributes/traits panel with rarity percentages per trait
- [ ] Ownership info: current owner (linked to profile)
- [ ] Price section: current listing price + buy button, or "Make Offer" if unlisted
- [ ] Offers tab: all active offers with accept/cancel actions
- [ ] Activity tab: full transaction history (mints, sales, transfers, listings)
- [ ] Price history chart (line graph of past sales)
- [ ] "More from this collection" section at bottom
- [ ] Share button (copy link, Twitter share)

### API Support
- [ ] Add `GET /marketplace/nfts/{id}/history` for provenance/activity
- [ ] Add `GET /marketplace/nfts/{id}/offers` for active offers
- [ ] Add `GET /marketplace/nfts/{id}/related` for same-collection NFTs

---

## Phase 9: Trading UX (Tensor-style Instant Actions)

### Listing Flow
- [ ] "List for Sale" modal: set price, review royalties + platform fee, confirm
- [ ] Batch listing: select multiple NFTs → list all at once
- [ ] Edit listing price without delisting
- [ ] Auto-delist on transfer

### Buying Flow
- [ ] One-click buy with transaction preview (price + fees breakdown)
- [ ] Cart / multi-buy: add multiple listed NFTs and purchase in one transaction
- [ ] Insufficient balance warning with "Add funds" prompt

### Offer Flow
- [ ] "Make Offer" modal: set offer amount + expiry
- [ ] Collection-wide offers (offer on any NFT in a collection)
- [ ] Counter-offer support
- [ ] Auto-expire offers based on config

### Transaction UX
- [ ] Transaction status toast: pending → confirming → confirmed → finalized
- [ ] Transaction retry on failure
- [ ] Recent transactions drawer (accessible from header)

---

## Phase 10: Activity Feed & Analytics

### Activity Feed
- [ ] Create `activity.stx` global activity page
- [ ] Real-time feed: sales, listings, delistings, offers, transfers
- [ ] Filter by event type
- [ ] Filter by collection
- [ ] Per-collection activity tab on collection page

### Analytics Dashboard
- [ ] Collection analytics: floor price chart, volume chart, listings chart over time
- [ ] Holder distribution pie chart
- [ ] Top holders leaderboard
- [ ] Sales volume (24h / 7d / 30d / all-time)
- [ ] Unique buyers/sellers count
- [ ] Average sale price trend

### API Support
- [ ] Add `GET /marketplace/activity` with type/collection filters + pagination
- [ ] Add `GET /marketplace/collections/{slug}/analytics` for charts data
- [ ] Add `GET /marketplace/collections/{slug}/holders` for holder stats

---

## Phase 11: User Profile & Portfolio

- [ ] Redesign `profile.stx` as a Tensor-style portfolio page
- [ ] Tabs: Owned, Listed, Offers Made, Offers Received, Activity
- [ ] Portfolio value estimation (owned NFTs × floor price)
- [ ] Unrealized P&L (purchase price vs current floor)
- [ ] Quick actions from portfolio: list, transfer, burn
- [ ] View any wallet's profile via `/profile/{walletAddress}`
- [ ] Favorite/watchlist collections

### API Support
- [ ] Add `GET /marketplace/profile/{wallet}/portfolio` with value calculations
- [ ] Add `GET /marketplace/profile/{wallet}/offers` (made + received)
- [ ] Add `GET /marketplace/profile/{wallet}/activity`

---

## Phase 12: Staking & Rewards

- [ ] Add staking methods to TokenService using `ts-tokens/staking`
- [ ] Create staking pool management (create pool, set rewards, set lock period)
- [ ] Build `staking.stx` page: stake/unstake UI, rewards display, APY
- [ ] Show staked status on NFT cards (locked badge)
- [ ] Claim rewards flow
- [ ] Staking leaderboard

### Database
- [ ] Create `staking_pools` table
- [ ] Create `stakes` table (nft_id, wallet, staked_at, unlocks_at)
- [ ] Create `staking_rewards` table

### API
- [ ] `POST /staking/stake` - Stake NFT
- [ ] `POST /staking/unstake` - Unstake NFT
- [ ] `POST /staking/claim` - Claim rewards
- [ ] `GET /staking/pools` - List pools
- [ ] `GET /staking/pool/{id}` - Pool detail + user stakes

---

## Phase 13: Governance & DAO

- [ ] Integrate `ts-governance` for Hoodies DAO
- [ ] Build `governance.stx` page: active proposals, voting, results
- [ ] NFT-based voting (1 Hoodie = 1 vote) using `nftVoting()`
- [ ] Create proposal flow: title, description, options, voting period
- [ ] Vote flow: select option, sign transaction
- [ ] Proposal lifecycle: pending → active → passed/rejected → executed
- [ ] Treasury overview: balance, recent distributions

### Database
- [ ] Create `proposals` table
- [ ] Create `votes` table
- [ ] Create `treasury_transactions` table

### API
- [ ] `POST /governance/proposals` - Create proposal
- [ ] `GET /governance/proposals` - List proposals
- [ ] `POST /governance/vote` - Cast vote
- [ ] `POST /governance/execute` - Execute passed proposal
- [ ] `GET /governance/treasury` - Treasury overview

---

## Phase 14: DeFi Integration

- [ ] Add Jupiter swap widget to the marketplace (buy SOL → mint/buy NFTs)
- [ ] Token-gated access: require holding a Hoodie for exclusive features
- [ ] Compressed NFT support via `ts-tokens/compressed-token` for gas-efficient minting
- [ ] Solana Actions / Blinks: shareable mint & buy links using `ts-tokens/actions`

### API
- [ ] `GET /defi/swap/quote` - Get Jupiter swap quote
- [ ] `POST /defi/swap/execute` - Execute swap
- [ ] `POST /actions/mint` - Blink-compatible mint endpoint
- [ ] `POST /actions/buy` - Blink-compatible buy endpoint

---

## Phase 15: Cross-Marketplace & Aggregation

- [ ] Integrate cross-marketplace listing using `crossListNFT()` (Magic Eden, Tensor)
- [ ] Show aggregated listings from external marketplaces
- [ ] Best price comparison across marketplaces using `getBestPrice()`
- [ ] Cancel cross-listings using `cancelCrossListings()`
- [ ] Display marketplace source badges on NFT cards

### API
- [ ] `POST /nfts/cross-list` - List across marketplaces
- [ ] `GET /nfts/{id}/listings` - Aggregated listings from all marketplaces
- [ ] `DELETE /nfts/cross-list` - Cancel cross-listings

---

## Phase 16: Security Hardening

- [ ] Transaction simulation before execution using `simulateTransaction()`
- [ ] Royalty bypass detection using `detectRoyaltyBypass()`
- [ ] MEV protection on trades using `ts-tokens/security`
- [ ] Rate limiting on mint/buy/offer endpoints
- [ ] Wallet address validation on all inputs
- [ ] Admin audit log for all privileged actions
- [ ] Compliance report generation using `generateComplianceReport()`

---

## Phase 17: Performance & Infrastructure

- [ ] Batch RPC calls using address lookup tables (`ts-tokens/batch`)
- [ ] Metadata caching layer (Redis or in-memory) with TTL
- [ ] Image CDN / optimization for NFT thumbnails
- [ ] WebSocket support for real-time price & activity updates
- [ ] Background job queue for on-chain syncing
- [ ] Database indexing audit for query performance
- [ ] RPC failover configuration (primary + fallback endpoints)

---

## Phase 18: Polish & Launch

- [ ] Mobile-responsive overhaul for all marketplace pages
- [ ] Dark mode / theme toggle
- [ ] Empty states for zero-data screens (no listings, no offers, etc.)
- [ ] Error boundary pages (404, 500, wallet disconnected)
- [ ] SEO: meta tags, Open Graph images for collections & NFTs
- [ ] Favicon + branding consistency
- [ ] Onboarding flow for first-time users (connect wallet → browse → buy)
- [ ] Production RPC endpoint + Helius API key
- [ ] Mainnet deployment checklist
- [ ] Load testing on devnet before mainnet launch
